# Giáo án Minna N5 — core

Static **Docusaurus 3** study site (Vietnamese + Japanese). Repo root = app root (no `website/` folder).

## Stack & commands

- Node **20** (see `.nvmrc`)
- `npm start` · `npm run build` · output `build/`
- Vercel: root repo, Output Directory `build`

## Layout

| Path | Role |
|------|------|
| `docs/` | Lesson + kana markdown |
| `docs/kana/` | Hiragana / katakana / tenten |
| `sidebars.ts` | Sidebar order (must stay in sync with new docs) |
| `playlist-map.json` | Minato video IDs ↔ lesson files |
| `src/css/custom.css` | Theme (warm light + soft dark) |

## Non-negotiables

- Learner may **not** know kanji → every kanji word needs `漢字（ひらがな）` (or verb stem `行（い）きます`)
- Prefer structured notes over raw YouTube transcripts
- Match existing lesson style: mirror `docs/bai-01-cau-danh-tu.md` / `docs/bai-02-chi-thi-tu.md`
- After doc/sidebar changes: run `npm run build` (broken links throw)

## Do not

- Reintroduce nested `website/` app folder
- Use romaji as the primary reading for kanji (hiragana only)
- Leave `:::info Đang soạn` stubs when finishing a lesson
